# Keep text files byte-stable across platforms. Storyboard SHA-256 is part of
# the task identity and is computed over the file bytes, so a CRLF checkout on
# Windows would otherwise change the hash and break tests/idempotency.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never apply text conversion to media.
*.mp4 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
